{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國導演James Gunn入主DC影業後，他由執導的DC電影宇宙頭炮《超人》（Superman）口碑票房不錯，但之後他監製的《超女》（Supergirl）劣評兼蝕本，來到第3套電影《泥面人》，不講大牌超級英雄故事，卻講蝙蝠俠其中一個冷門敵</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T16:20:34.615880+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T16:01:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T16:18:05.302636+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T16:18:05.302636+00:00","content_hash":"b281e7c87ff89e0e12fcaa74187e91b2900e7d79a243f5f9a7bba2fbe2f5ad6e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}